Z||000045||jch82||11-09-2001||02:30 AM||||Of course I will have the installation manual with pics! Anything to help out a friend. An installation manual would definitely help out with sales in my opinion. Especially for those that aren't sure about doing something like this because they think it might be to difficult.<P>On a side note, when are the Z3 vents coming out? Are they going on the outer sides of the hood scoop or on the top part up front?<P>**My fav question**<BR>Any pics?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82_2.jpg"> ||||reg||14
