Z||000049||MinnGreenGT||11-09-2001||05:34 PM||||Ferrari-Momo... is this what you mean by Z3 vents?<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.wholesalehyperformance.com/newest-scans/e36-blue-z3-fenders.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.wholesalehyperformance.com/digital-camera-pics1/z3-fender-insert1.jpg">  <P>If so, that'd be <B>cool!</B><P>This photo came from <A HREF="http://www.wholesalehyperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.wholesalehyperformance.com</A>   ...they specialize in ricer parts! ...they're charging $125 for a pair.||||reg||1
