Z||000051||kevin||11-09-2001||07:27 PM||||I think your artistry is unsurpassed. Wonderful! However, I might suggest a less squared off profile. As it now appears, the 'up-down' appearance makes the butt bigger. I suggest blending in a forward angle aabove the tail lights. This will make the Fiero design more lean-foreward. This idea is not meant to be critical, but rather complimentary from one artist to the other. I might also suggest adding a built in spoiler similar to what Chevy did to thier second generatin Comaro.Another thought, how about incorporating C-5 'Vette tailight bezels. From the year view, it will confuse alot of people (for the better).Keep us posted on your project.  ||||reg||1
